    note: 'worker apparatus failed — max_tokens',
    theory: 'If “hidden structure” is given an apparatus criterion (e.g. compressibility under a fixed encoder), the claim is falsifiable per encoder, but unfalsifiable in general — making the bare claim closer to a research disposition than a Theory.',
